<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27693" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mălĕa</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mălēa</span></b> , ae,
			f. (collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mălĕae</span></b> , ārum,
			f., <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 4, 12, 1</span></i> B. and K.), =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μαλέα</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μάλεια</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a promontory in the Peloponnesus, at the south of
				Laconia</i>, now <i>C. Malea</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 34,
				32, 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 3, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 5,
				8, § 22</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 4, 12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 5,
				193</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. Am. 2, 16, 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Prop. 3,
			17</span></i> (4, 18), 8; <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 2, 33</span></i>.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mălēus</span></b> ,
				a, um, <i>adj., of</i> or <i>belonging to the promontory of Malea, Malean</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jugum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					2, 9, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">3, 6,
		3</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
